# Draw sub-phase profile (27 Nov): after 0110/0112 the busiest draws spend ~1.1-1.2 ms a frame each in the constants
# and descriptors phases, which already reuse what they can. With BOTS_DRAW_PROFILE=1 a line per stats window,
# "draw sub-phases per frame", splits them: viewport, system constants, float constants, bool/loop + fetch constants
# (time, and uploads vs reuses per constant buffer), pipeline layout lookup, texture sets (none / same as the last
# draw / found / new) and descriptor updates, to pick the next trim.
